{"version":1,"content":"<p>由劉德華投資的電影《關於那隻烏龜的故事》，由舞台劇改編而成，今天（14日）舉行開鏡禮，華仔率領一眾舞台劇版原班人馬演員，包括阮小儀、楊樂文（Lokman）、梁仲恆（阿炳）、王耀祖、阮韻珊（Melody）、倪秉郎、胡麗英等，聯同龜龜「小陸」亮相，大派利市提升團隊士氣。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.471690+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:09:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:57.374407+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"e937bd26661d3174f41b9e9c190d2f11ce2ea6f8350dffb52f76b63bbb497bcd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}